@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:……我一直都力求采取正确的行动。<br>我一直在思考全员存活的方法。|#0205Trial09_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

